<title>DENMARK: Finland sets 500 mln Dkk 4 pct bond due 2000. [Corrected 16:30 gmt]</title>
<headline>Finland sets 500 mln Dkk 4 pct bond due 2000. [Corrected 16:30 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland issued a 500 million Danish crown four percent bond due 2000, lead managers HSBC Holdings (corrects name of bank) and Denmark's Sydbank A/S said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>They said the issue would be listed on London's Stock Exchange on November 15,1996 with Sydbank in charge of sales at market price.</p>
<p>No further details were given.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
